# M12-D2: line endings are LF in the repository and in every checkout (Windows clones with core.autocrlf=true
# included), so the static tests that read YAML/SQL/CSS as text behave the same on every machine.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch binary files.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.p8 binary
*.p12 binary
*.mobileprovision binary
*.cer binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.tar.gz binary
